    "committer": "Florian J. Auer <florian.auer@informatik.uni-augsburg.de>",
    "message": "Fix R CMD check and BiocCheck issues, bump version to 1.35.1\n\n- Add inst/CITATION with the Bioinformatics publication\n  (Auer et al., 2018, doi:10.1093/bioinformatics/btx683)\n- Replace httr:::default_ua() with internal ndex_default_ua()\n  using utils::getFromNamespace()\n- Import utils (packageVersion, tail) and RCX in NAMESPACE;\n  remove unused plyr and tidyr from Imports\n- Fix lost braces in Rd docs (link{} -> \\link{ndex_connect})\n- Replace deprecated @docType package with \"_PACKAGE\"\n- Convert LICENSE to DCF stub for BSD_3_clause; move full\n  license text to LICENSE.md\n- Move ndex_api_config.yml from R/ to data-raw/ and update\n  references in docs and vignette\n- Extend .Rbuildignore (data-raw, doc, man-roxygen*, LICENSE.md,\n  Rd2pdf and BiocCheck output)\n- Update NEWS\n",
    "time": 1794401401
  },
